    "loadError": "The game could not load. Please reload this page.",
    "help": "<ol><li>Enter starts, resumes and replays. WASD or arrows move; hold any WASD direction for 0.5s to sprint; stop moving to return to walking. Space jumps. Mouse looks.</li><li>Q switches between the mop and last weapon. E cycles owned weapons. Hold left mouse to spray, or aim at a floor stain for 0.8s to mop. Hold right mouse to aim: spray/shotgun width ×0.8 and range ×1.4, rocket blast radius ×0.8 and travel limit ×1.4, movement speed ×0.7.</li><li>Satisfaction starts at 50%. A customer who sees a live cockroach for 0.85s costs 10 points and shows ! overhead. Each customer/cockroach pair is penalized once. Walls and shelves block their view.</li><li>Customers ignore dead cockroaches and spraying itself. Spraying a customer costs 15 points, once per customer per continuous mouse-button hold.</li><li>Cleaning a floor stain restores 5 points, capped at 100%. Six or more uncleaned stains cost 10 satisfaction points every 15s; reducing them below six resets this timer. Three stains exist initially; two more appear every 30s of gameplay.</li><li>There are three cockroaches. Each elimination restores 5 points. Each takes 0.9s of accumulated spray hits. Corpses disappear after 4s; replacements arrive 9s after elimination. Play continues until satisfaction reaches zero.</li><li>Esc or leaving the window pauses the game, timer, stain generation and replacements. ? opens help.</li><li>Each can provides 30s of spray. A warning appears at 20%. Aim at the red vending machine to open the shop. Earn 20P per kill and 10P per clean. Refill costs 100P, 3 bombs cost 2000P. Sequential upgrades cost 500/1000/1500/3000P; the last unlocks a five-shell shotgun. Refill restores both spray and shotgun. Purchases spend points, and gameplay continues.</li><li>Every2 minutes: level up, pest speed ×1.2, +3 pests and +2 customers. Store width/depth ×1.3 only at levels2,3,10,20,30…</li><li>Every minute a free gacha appears at the center. Aim and left click to draw once: 200P:28%, three5× pests:20%, 500P:15%, ten pests:10%, 1000P:4%, 2000P:2%, 5000P:1%, rockets:20%. Points are awarded immediately. Bonus pests never respawn; rockets refill to a maximum3. One undrawn machine remains; draws do not accumulate.</li><li>Starting points: 0P. Q toggles mop; E cycles weapons. Bombs explode after 1s within 1.5m. Shotgun instantly kills in an 8m cone, one click per shell. Customer hits cost 15 satisfaction each. Replay resets points and upgrades.</li><li>Settings control sound on/off, master volume and separate voice/weapon/other effect volumes. Spray audio loops only while actually spraying. Pausing or leaving the window stops audio.</li><li>Maintain satisfaction at 90% or higher for 30s to earn100P, repeating every30s. Dropping below90% resets the timer. Pausing freezes it.</li><li>Aim assist helps mouse movement while aiming and gently tracks nearby visible pests while left click is held. Releasing left click stops tracking. It ignores customers, corpses and occluded pests. Choose None, Weak, Medium or Strong in Settings (default Weak).</li></ol><p>Embedded browsers may limit the cursor at the edge. Hold Shift to reposition it without turning, or open this URL directly in Chrome or Edge for unrestricted mouse look.</p><p>Starting points:0P. Buy one Goki Trap for10,000P, repeatedly. E selects it; left click eliminates every live pest with normal kill rewards. Customers are unaffected.</p><p>Optional Auto-spray activates only with spray selected, while the center crosshair directly hits a visible live pest within range. Other tools never auto-fire. Normal supply use and customer penalties still apply.</p>",
