    "titleRulesContent": "<p class=\"guide-lead\">Keep the store clean and your customers happy.</p><div class=\"guide-grid\"><article class=\"guide-card\"><svg class=\"guide-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#guide-spray\"/></svg><h3>Spray before they spot it</h3><p>Each kill restores5% satisfaction and earns20P. A customer spotting a pest costs10%; hitting a customer costs15% each.</p></article><article class=\"guide-card\"><svg class=\"guide-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#guide-mop\"/></svg><h3>Mop up the mess</h3><p>Each stain cleaned restores5% and earns10P. Two new stains appear every30s. Six or more stains cost10% every15s.</p></article><article class=\"guide-card\"><svg class=\"guide-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#guide-heart\"/></svg><h3>Protect satisfaction</h3><p>Start at50%. At0%, the game ends. Maintain90% or higher for30s to earn100P.</p></article><article class=\"guide-card\"><svg class=\"guide-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#guide-settings\"/></svg><h3>Earn and upgrade</h3><p>Buy refills and upgrades at the red vending machine. A free gacha appears every minute, with200–5000P rewards too (5000P:1%). Every2 minutes, +3 pests and +2 customers. Store width/depth ×1.3 at levels2,3,10,20…</p></article></div><p class=\"guide-note\">Spray lasts30s per can. Start with0P. Refills cost100P; sequential upgrades cost500/1000/1500/3000P. Open ? for full details.</p>",
    "titleControlsContent": "<p class=\"guide-lead\">Move, spray and make the floor shine.</p><div class=\"guide-grid\"><article class=\"guide-card\"><svg class=\"guide-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#guide-keys\"/></svg><h3>W A S D to move</h3><p>W forward, S backward, A left, D right. Hold any direction for0.5s to sprint. Space jumps; Esc pauses.</p></article><article class=\"guide-card\"><svg class=\"guide-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#guide-mouse\"/></svg><h3>Mouse to look and use</h3><p>Hold left click to spray or mop. Rockets, bombs and shotgun fire once per click.</p></article><article class=\"guide-card\"><svg class=\"guide-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#guide-spray\"/></svg><h3>Hold right click to aim</h3><p>Effect width ×0.8, range ×1.4, movement ×0.7. Shotgun shots stay inside the square.</p></article><article class=\"guide-card\"><svg class=\"guide-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#guide-mop\"/></svg><h3>Q for mop / E for weapons</h3><p>Q toggles mop and last weapon; E cycles owned weapons. Aim at a nearby vending machine or gacha and left click.</p></article></div><p class=\"guide-note\">For unrestricted mouse look use a regular Chrome/Edge tab. In embedded browsers, hold Shift to reposition the cursor.</p>",
